WEBVTT

00:09:29.543 --> 00:09:32.551
today I would like to invent
something called multicellularity,

00:09:32.575 --> 00:09:33.848
and I'm going to do this."

00:09:33.872 --> 00:09:36.524
And I'm sure it wasn't a popular
decision at the time --

00:09:36.548 --> 00:09:37.575
(Laughter)

00:09:37.599 --> 00:09:39.205
but somehow, it managed to do it.

00:09:39.229 --> 00:09:41.795
And then, multicellular
organisms began to populate

00:09:41.819 --> 00:09:43.195
all these ancestral oceans,

00:09:43.219 --> 00:09:44.407
and they thrived.

00:09:44.431 --> 00:09:45.964
And we have them here today.

00:09:46.789 --> 00:09:49.786
Land masses began to emerge
from the surface of the oceans,

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.264
and another creature thought,

00:09:51.288 --> 00:09:54.077
"Hey, that looks like a really nice
piece of real estate.

00:09:54.101 --> 00:09:55.352
I'd like to move there."

00:09:55.376 --> 00:09:56.535
"Are you crazy?

00:09:56.559 --> 00:09:59.843
You're going to desiccate out there.
Nothing can live out of water."

00:09:59.867 --> 00:10:01.024
But life found a way,